<title>CHINA: China's copper output seen at 900,000 tonnes in 96.</title>
<headline>China's copper output seen at 900,000 tonnes in 96.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China expects to produce 900,000 tonnes of copper in 1996, the China Daily said on Tuesday quoting the China National Nonferrous Metals Industry Corp.</p>
<p>China's copper output totalled 822,900 tonnes in the first 11 months of this year, up 6.77 percent from the same period last year.</p>
</text>
